<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-008" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-leguang" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-leguang">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-leguang:mirror" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-leguang:mirror:m0000" ref="67b_2b2_4b8">衛伯玉</persName>為尚書令，見<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-leguang:mirror:m0009" ref="591_360_8ca">樂廣</persName>與中朝名士談議，奇之曰：「自昔諸人沒已來，常恐微言將絕。今乃復聞斯言於君矣！」命子弟造之曰：「此人，人之水鏡也，見之若披雲霧覩青天。」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-leguang:wang-yin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-leguang:wang-yin:m0000" ref="67b_2b2_4b8">衛瓘</persName>有名理，及與<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-leguang:wang-yin:m0008" ref="0db_22c_332_*A">何晏</persName>、<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-leguang:wang-yin:m0011" ref="o5w_eyp_jhb">鄧颺</persName>等數共談講，見<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-leguang:wang-yin:m0020" ref="591_360_8ca">廣</persName>奇之曰：『每見此人，則瑩然猶廓雲霧而睹青天。』</p>
</text>
